{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5276420","formula":"C₁₅H₂₄O₅","hill":"C15H24O5","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":24.0,"O":5.0},"names":{"en":"Dihydroartemisinin","uk":"Дигідроартемізинін"},"descriptions":{"en":"Dihydroartemisinin (also known as dihydroqinghaosu, artenimol or DHA) is a drug used to treat malaria. Dihydroartemisinin is the active metabolite of all artemisinin compounds (artemisinin, artesunate, artemether, etc.) and is also available as a drug in itself. It is a semi-synthetic derivative of artemisinin and is widely used as an intermediate in the preparation of other artemisinin-derived antimalarial drugs.","uk":"Дигідроартемізинін (англ. Dihydroartemisinin) — напівсинтетичний антипротозойний препарат, який застосовується для лікування малярії. Дигідроартемізинін є активним метаболітом всіх складових артемізиніну (артемізиніну, артесунату, артеметру та інших), які також застосовуються як лікарські засоби."},"fame":16,"pubchemCid":6918483,"mass":284.35,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@@H]1CC[C@H]2[C@H](C(O[C@H]3[C@@]24[C@H]1CC[C@](O3)(OO4)C)O)C","inchikey":"BJDCWCLMFKKGEE-HVDUHBCDSA-N","iupac":"(1R,4S,5R,8S,9R,12R,13R)-1,5,9-trimethyl-11,14,15,16-tetraoxatetracyclo[10.3.1.04,13.08,13]hexadecan-10-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"6918483","atoms":44,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.361,"y":0.62,"z":-1.515,"el":"O"},{"x":1.193,"y":1.353,"z":1.171,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.113,"y":1.537,"z":0.886,"el":"O"},{"x":0.788,"y":1.945,"z":-1.077,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.4,"y":1.915,"z":0.707,"el":"O"},{"x":0.083,"y":-0.22,"z":-0.363,"el":"C"},{"x":1.251,"y":-1.257,"z":-0.353,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.278,"y":-0.902,"z":-0.671,"el":"C"},{"x":0.95,"y":-2.488,"z":0.543,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.016,"y":0.618,"z":0.938,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.531,"y":-2.119,"z":0.234,"el":"C"},